{"code":"048430","name":"유라테크","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"자동차부품","sector_desc":"완성차에 들어가는 부품 제조. 완성차 생산량과 전동화(EV) 전환 속도, 환율의 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 1987년 설립된 자동차부품전문업체로, 2001년 코스닥시장에 상장하였음. 종속회사로 2012년 설립된 중국 일조승우무역유한공사(지분율 100%)와 2019년 설립된 베트남 유라테크베트남유한회사(지분율 100%)를 보유하고 있음. 자동차용 점화코일, 점화플러그를 제조 판매하며, 주요 고객으로 현대/기아자동차, 현대모비스 등에 안정적인 매출이 이루어지고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-20","n_days":299,"close":5390.0,"open":5490.0,"high":5630.0,"low":5340.0,"volume":24434,"amount":131699260.0,"ret_1d":-3.5778,"gap":-1.7889,"range_pct":5.3803,"ret_5":-2.1779,"ret_20":-13.3441,"ret_60":-3.0576,"ret_120":-36.9591,"ret_250":-31.8584,"ma20":5877.5,"ma60":5913.1667,"ma120":6267.8333,"ma200":6961.9,"close_vs_ma200":-22.5786,"close_vs_ma60":-8.8475,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":14.1533,"r2_60":0.0317,"slope_120":-42.4809,"r2_120":0.4081,"slope_250":-34.3875,"r2_250":0.6582,"high52":9760.0,"low52":5130.0,"pos_52w":5.6156,"dd_52w":-44.7746,"mdd_1y":-42.2346,"atr14_pct":5.2478,"vol_ann_60":39.4813,"vol_avg20":137133.35,"vol_ratio20":0.1782,"vr5":0.4875,"vr20":1.6487,"amount_avg5":189722276.0,"amount_avg20":860007658.5,"amount_avg60":453263834.0,"obv_chg20":43.5355,"turnover_20":23.8079,"pv_eff_20":-0.5605,"rsi14":36.3471,"frgn_net_5":13957.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.1212,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.1212,"frgn_net_20":1237.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0107,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0107,"frgn_net_60":-6135.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0533,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.0533,"frgn_net_120":37922.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.3292,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.3292,"foreign_ratio":1.91,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.03,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":11.0,"op_margin_q":2.0295,"op_qoq":161.1111,"op_turnaround":1.0,"op_yoy":-8.3333,"rev_yoy":10.387,"op_trend_4q":28.8889,"fin_period":"202606","roe":4.92,"debt_ratio":21.61,"per":8.22,"pbr":0.39,"div_yield":3.71,"foreign_rate":1